\section{See also}

Related infrastructure and interfaces: \code{lm()}, \code{model.frame()},
\code{model.matrix()}, \code{splines::bs()}, \code{boot::boot()},
\code{quantreg::boot.rq()}, \code{quantreg::predict.rq()}, and
\code{stats::predict.lm()}. These comparisons do not add runtime dependencies
on \code{boot} or \code{quantreg}.

